Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Abstract", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 
   3.97680718244866*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"12465cb7-43fc-4e82-aea7-\
b1ba60dee697"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In this notebook, we extend and formalize the \[ScriptCapitalU]\
\[ScriptCapitalD] Calculus, a computational frontend for unambiguous, \
symbolic tensor calculations in the Wolfram Language. \[ScriptCapitalU]\
\[ScriptCapitalD] features concise, but unambiguous input like ",
 StyleBox["T[\[ScriptCapitalU][\[Mu]],\[ScriptCapitalD][\[Nu]]]", "Input"],
 " and typeset output like ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    SuperscriptBox["T", "\[Mu]"], "\[Nu]"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "8fe4d1dd-6064-4b11-b3f5-77e35deaf48f"],
 ". "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807359325186*^9}, {3.97680761771111*^9, 
   3.976807629196557*^9}, {3.9768330835806427`*^9, 3.97683321568886*^9}, {
   3.976833313200728*^9, 3.976833313201301*^9}, {3.9768333675841*^9, 
   3.976833464643084*^9}, {3.976833515416271*^9, 3.9768335351197453`*^9}, {
   3.976835701531886*^9, 
   3.976835800218018*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3984ae6a-6a5f-4fe4-860a-\
d21175f4720b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We take the view that Wolfram\[CloseCurlyQuote]s ",
 StyleBox[ButtonBox["Symbolic Tensors",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://reference.wolfram.com/language/tutorial/SymbolicTensors.\
html"], None},
  ButtonNote->
   "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/tutorial/SymbolicTensors.html"],
  FontSlant->"Italic",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 " plus repository functions like ",
 StyleBox[ButtonBox["MetricTensor",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://resources.wolframcloud.com/FunctionRepository/resources/\
MetricTensor/?i=MetricTensor&searchapi=https%3A%2F%2Fresources.wolframcloud.\
com%2FFunctionRepository%2Fsearch"], None},
  ButtonNote->
   "https://resources.wolframcloud.com/FunctionRepository/resources/\
MetricTensor/?i=MetricTensor&searchapi=https%3A%2F%2Fresources.wolframcloud.\
com%2FFunctionRepository%2Fsearch"],
  FontSlant->"Italic",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 " and ",
 StyleBox[ButtonBox["RiemannTensor",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://resources.wolframcloud.com/FunctionRepository/resources/\
RiemannTensor/?i=RiemannTensor&searchapi=https%3A%2F%2Fresources.wolframcloud.\
com%2FFunctionRepository%2Fsearch"], None},
  ButtonNote->
   "https://resources.wolframcloud.com/FunctionRepository/resources/\
RiemannTensor/?i=RiemannTensor&searchapi=https%3A%2F%2Fresources.wolframcloud.\
com%2FFunctionRepository%2Fsearch"],
  FontSlant->"Italic",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 " furnish powerful, backend tools for differential geometry and relativity. \
\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] on the other hand, focuses on structural \
logic of tensor algebra. Building on our previous notebooks in special and \
general relativity, we introduce a \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]glass-box\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] frontend with syntactic and semantic capabilities: "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807359325186*^9}, {3.97680761771111*^9, 
   3.976807629196557*^9}, {3.9768330835806427`*^9, 3.97683321568886*^9}, {
   3.976833313200728*^9, 3.976833313201301*^9}, {3.9768333675841*^9, 
   3.976833464643084*^9}, {3.976833515416271*^9, 3.9768335351197453`*^9}, {
   3.976835701531886*^9, 
   3.9768358877335*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d2b8f9a2-e4b5-48a9-abe5-\
d7d78a933477"],

Cell["valence checking (type safety)", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807365703022*^9}, 
   3.9768334775185337`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"cc9e1d10-182e-4e14-94d8-\
6466d8c3df67"],

Cell["automatic index canonicalization and coalescing", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807370937777*^9}, {3.976833545261194*^9, 
   3.976833548533648*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e9806e23-5d07-4c0f-8358-\
73d8dad8d97e"],

Cell["collision-free coordinate transformations", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807381680141*^9}, {3.976833483014674*^9, 
   3.976833483998077*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"03f31fab-e499-4b43-bda1-\
7c10d9a9804e"],

Cell["\<\
\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] should be useful for applications of \
differential geometry beyond relativity. Differential geometry is enjoying \
rapidly growing utility in computer vision and robotics, and has long been \
central to classical and quantum mechanics, to field theory, and to gauge \
theory. We have expressed interest in these applications in many earlier \
notebooks and plan to revisit them, buttressing our calculations with formal \
rigour via \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD].\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9768076446562653`*^9, 3.9768077675503798`*^9}, {
  3.976833556708728*^9, 3.976833673163127*^9}, {3.976835921485915*^9, 
  3.976835929878889*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3fa6a177-17b1-428b-b3bb-\
59b27b2efe04"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This notebook is the first in a series dedicated specifically to general \
relativity, however, by implementing Eric Poisson\[CloseCurlyQuote]s ",
 StyleBox[ButtonBox["A Relativist's Toolkit",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://a.co/d/8pT6XUR"], None},
  ButtonNote->"https://a.co/d/8pT6XUR"],
  FontSlant->"Italic",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 " in \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD]. We will verify his derivations ",
 StyleBox["ab initio",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", assuring not just correctness, but rigour of the derivation. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.976807855855891*^9}, {
   3.976831541286274*^9, 3.9768315519650793`*^9}, {3.976831585041976*^9, 
   3.976831622357461*^9}, {3.976831661271888*^9, 3.976831792670689*^9}, {
   3.976833681362753*^9, 3.976833974657584*^9}, {3.976835981779799*^9, 
   3.9768360007192583`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0cbf9991-3593-4696-a6be-\
cf276cef1fe6"],

Cell["\<\
Finally, we outline our roadmap for a \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] \
compiler backend: a translation layer to map \[ScriptCapitalU]\
\[ScriptCapitalD] expressions onto SymbolicTensor and appropriate \
function-repository elements. We intend that users can derive physical laws \
in the high-assurance \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] environment and then \
seamlessly compile them to Wolfram\[CloseCurlyQuote]s infrastructure. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.976807855855891*^9}, {
   3.976831541286274*^9, 3.9768315519650793`*^9}, {3.976831585041976*^9, 
   3.976831622357461*^9}, {3.976831661271888*^9, 3.976831792670689*^9}, {
   3.976833681362753*^9, 3.976833974657584*^9}, {3.976835981779799*^9, 
   3.9768360603819313`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fb11a969-3871-4722-a943-\
fd639187fa61"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This series is an exercise in formal (machine-checked) mathematics with \
compiler-like architecture. While the Wolfram language is not, ",
 StyleBox["prima facie",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", a purely formal system like Rocq or Lean or TLA+, Wolfram\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s symbolic algebra lets us have many formal checks, not to \
mention numerical agility, throughout our work. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.976807855855891*^9}, {
   3.976831541286274*^9, 3.9768315519650793`*^9}, {3.976831585041976*^9, 
   3.976831622357461*^9}, {3.976831661271888*^9, 3.976831792670689*^9}, {
   3.976833681362753*^9, 3.976834036825973*^9}, {3.976836069495987*^9, 
   3.9768361274544888`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0a2f6dc6-b1b5-48d5-a59b-\
918d790381f7"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 
   3.976807866159943*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ad594a56-3f96-4d05-a2d5-\
372039a76326"],

Cell["\<\
Wolfram Mathematica is a superpower for general-purpose algebra and calculus. \
The Wolfram Function Repository offers fast, reliable, sophisticated tools \
like MetricTensor, ChristoffelSymbol, EinsteinTensor, and \
SolveEinsteinEquations for relativity problems.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.9768078346242523`*^9}, {
   3.9768078710978737`*^9, 3.976807910962021*^9}, {3.97683405083388*^9, 
   3.976834134924266*^9}, {3.976836142905602*^9, 
   3.976836238398942*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6776a532-7f5f-4e13-bf42-\
933ffe542cca"],

Cell["\<\
However, for physicists who need to understand the derivations\[LongDash]the \
index raising, lowering, and contracting\[LongDash]these tools can be opaque. \
They function as calculators: excellent for getting an answer, but obscure on \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]how.\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] They intentionally hide \
matrix operations, etc., inside a \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]black box\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], in the interest of getting results as quickly and \
noiselessly as possible.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.9768078346242523`*^9}, {
   3.9768078710978737`*^9, 3.976808034334964*^9}, {3.9768341421799307`*^9, 
   3.9768342004965343`*^9}, {3.976836270221098*^9, 
   3.976836314196251*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2834b5d7-afd0-4067-8c5b-\
879581e0ddeb"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["A \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Glass Box\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] for \
Relativity", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.9768078346242523`*^9}, {
   3.9768078710978737`*^9, 
   3.9768080420897408`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9c6193e8-c614-4c5f-a716-\
c37e6d2f1bef"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook series aims to build complementary tools: a verifier and \
compiler. We are building a system that:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.9768078346242523`*^9}, {
   3.9768078710978737`*^9, 3.976808012037896*^9}, {3.976808060432528*^9, 
   3.976808071229828*^9}, {3.976834208046279*^9, 3.976834223651746*^9}, 
   3.976836330471979*^9},ExpressionUUID->"509aa617-075a-4512-9341-\
2ba42f5015d7"],

Cell["\<\
Enforces Grammar: \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] knows that adding a \
vector to a covector is physically meaningless and will stop with a valence \
check.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.9768078346242523`*^9}, {
   3.9768078710978737`*^9, 3.976808012037896*^9}, {3.976808060432528*^9, 
   3.9768081021360893`*^9}, {3.9768342332325077`*^9, 
   3.976834260989477*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a9784ab9-1c7f-4641-ab17-\
78b669049650"],

Cell["\<\
Preserves Notation: \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] manipulates tensors as \
whole symbolic objects, rather than as decorated arrays, preserving the index \
notation found in textbooks like Poisson\[CloseCurlyQuote]s.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.9768078346242523`*^9}, {
   3.9768078710978737`*^9, 3.976808012037896*^9}, {3.976808060432528*^9, 
   3.976808138687243*^9}, {3.976834265360507*^9, 
   3.976834279417452*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d196a6e9-ad1f-4a66-b242-\
fd06c700e5b5"],

Cell["\<\
Ensures rigour: \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] handles renaming of \
contraction-bound (dummy) indices via alpha-conversion, preventing the \
index-capture errors that plague pen-and-paper derivations.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.9768078346242523`*^9}, {
   3.9768078710978737`*^9, 3.976808012037896*^9}, {3.976808060432528*^9, 
   3.97680822413284*^9}, 3.97683161117509*^9, {3.976834284962158*^9, 
   3.976834312384186*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ac11065a-983d-41e1-bb53-\
4da011fe9a1f"],

Cell["\<\
Integrates well: \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] will eventually map to \
Wolfram\[CloseCurlyQuote]s existing support for tensors, treating that \
support as a target virtual machine.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9768343245698338`*^9, 
  3.9768343737066107`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"09950eb9-8f83-4787-9894-\
39d4e9d6807c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Our guide for this journey is Eric Poisson\[CloseCurlyQuote]s text, ",
 StyleBox["A Relativist\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Toolkit",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". We will proceed section by section, implementing his textual toolkit as a \
software toolkit."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.9768078346242523`*^9}, {
   3.9768078710978737`*^9, 3.976808012037896*^9}, {3.976808060432528*^9, 
   3.9768082534450912`*^9}, {3.976834401138342*^9, 3.9768344040338583`*^9}, {
   3.976836407372551*^9, 
   3.97683640757401*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3c670a7b-8cbd-438b-a37b-\
64d7c6262a2e"]
}, Open  ]],

