Cell["\<\
In this first part of a planned series, we build and test \[ScriptCapitalU]\
\[ScriptCapitalD]\[CloseCurlyQuote]s algebraic engine. Presaging component \
calculation, we introduce rules and functions for the structure of \
differential geometry, both generically and as applied to relativity. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
   3.9768076068674717`*^9}, {3.976807777446004*^9, 3.9768078346242523`*^9}, {
   3.9768078710978737`*^9, 3.976808012037896*^9}, {3.976808060432528*^9, 
