Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The Horizon: Part 3 and Beyond", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976832138854512*^9, 
  3.976832153434828*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ec7112ed-5c01-4a6d-a959-\
b6004676de7f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Following covariant derivatives and geodesics, we plan to introduce The \
\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] ",
 StyleBox["Component Compiler",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". This will link our formal, frontend structures to Wolfram\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s SymbolicTensor library and many support functions in the \
function repository, translating abstract geometric objects into concrete \
component arrays, e.g., mapping a formal Schwarzschild metric to its explicit \
4\[Times]4 matrix representation. We also envision expanding our ",
 StyleBox["valence",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " type-checker to include metadata about domains and dimensions for both \
expanded applicability, say to SU(3) gauge theory, and robustness."
